[38;2;124;124;124mR^{2n+1}, immersion into R^{2n}. The proper version: Whitney showed that every [0m
[38;2;124;124;124msmooth manifold admits a proper embedding into R^{2n+1}.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mThe construction: Take a countable locally finite cover by relatively compact [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mopen sets {U_i}. Take a partition of unity {φ_i} subordinate. Choose points and [0m[38;2;124;124;124mconstruct functions. Actually the standard construction of proper embedding:[0m

