[38;2;124;124;124mStep 1: Every smooth manifold admits a proper smooth function ρ: M → [0,∞). [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mProof: Take exhaustion K_1 ⊂ K_2 ⊂ ... compact with K_i ⊂ int K_{i+1}, ∪K_i = M.[0m[38;2;124;124;124mTake partition of unity, or use a locally finite cover and sum. Actually: Let [0m
