[38;2;124;124;124mpartition of unity. Define ρ(x) = Σ i·ψ_i(x). This is proper because ρ^{-1}[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m([0,N]) is contained in the union of finitely many U_i (those with i ≤ N plus [0m
